      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The electrocardiographic changes in patients with malignant arterial hypertension verified by the results of the pathoanatomic heart study have been analysed. The authors suggest a new classification of coronary arteries involvement in malignant hypertension. The informative value of Sokolov-Layon's criteria in malignant arterial hypertension is discussed."},
